  "body": "Gap found during the read-only DNS validation on #1860 (queue task 3076, 2026-10-29).\n\nAcceptance item on #1860 requires reporting whether `infra/dns/dns_config.yaml` (the declared DNS for 39 Porkbun zones, 151 records) is embedded in the fleet semantic index, and filing a gap issue if it is missing.\n\nWhat was checked: full-text search of this repo at main 5a34fa70 for `semantic` and for references to `dns_config` outside `infra/dns/` itself. No semantic-index manifest, embedding list, or index artifact in the repo references `infra/dns/dns_config.yaml`; the file is referenced only by `infra/dns/main.tf` and the project's own scripts.\n\nAsk: confirm where the fleet semantic index lives (it is not identifiable from this repo), embed `infra/dns/dns_config.yaml` in it, and note the embedding here. If the index lives elsewhere and already embeds the file, close this with a pointer to it.\n\nRefs: #1860\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- A named location for the fleet semantic index is recorded on this issue (owning repo/path or external system).\n- Evidence that `infra/dns/dns_config.yaml` is embedded in that index (a manifest or entry reference), or a pointer showing it already was.\n- If embedding cannot be done from this repo, the owning repo/system has a linked follow-up issue and this issue links it before closing.\n",
